## What this round produced

Scenario SL — "SPIT-LOCK / Sprayholt HRSG Attemperator AT-6": a 4-nozzle
HP spray attemperator at 541.0 C / 4.8 t/h spray / 620 t/h steam. Three
heterogeneous, individually-correct agents — STM (four-nozzle header mean T),
FW (spray-water coriolis), SHP (HP SH outlet pressure) — each report their
local loop in-spec. The conjunction is not a nozzle-true certificate. Nozzle 4
is magnetite-plugged (spray-lock). STM reads 541.0 C inside 530-550 (three
intact nozzles dominate the header). FW is 4.8 t/h inside 3.5-6.5 (header-true).
SHP is 12.4 MPa inside 11.8-12.8 (drum-true). Local steam TC infers 612.4 C
(healthy < 560; hold if > 580) and local dP 0.12 MPa (hold if < 0.25) but is
policy-treated as an EMI-nuisance tag unless STM mean also trips (2016 noisy
nozzle-TC nuisance). The coordination-failure CLASS is new to this factory:
HEADER-STEAM MEAN CERTIFICATE OF A LOCAL SPRAY-NOZZLE LOCK. Completes a
different family than live r01 galvanizing, r02 cupola, r21 CAV, r22 prill,
r41 perfusion, r42/r62 grid inspection, r61 sinter, r63 canal lock, r64 malt
kiln, and staged r14-r64 process plants. Here every agent is correct, the STM
average is looking at header-mean steam, and the playbook's three STM confirms
are not a nozzle-true certificate.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not cut spray below 4.8 t/h
while nozzle-4 steam TC > 580 C AND nozzle-4 dP < 0.25 MPa). TG-AT-6 strips
PB-AT-6's cut-spray, holds 4.8 t/h, runs a 7.2 s spray-step +8 pct (lock keeps
|Delta STM mean| 0.4 <= 0.5 K; intact would move >= 2.8), and isolates nozzle 4
after a 9.8 min HRSG-gallery human ratify. Immediate 8.4 t overheat is avoided
(0 from the draft). The PRIMARY episode nonetheless FAILS: 12 min of
unmonitored pre-t0 spray-lock had already creep-started 2.1 t of HP SH tubes.
Leak at +4.8 h; 18 h stall; $1.42M designed. Reward total -0.16 with process
heads honest and world loss un-netted.

Triple-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): stm.in_band -> cut_spray
(0.17 commissioned -> 0.50 at illusion -> 0.25 after ACh-gated
depression) AND fw.ok -> cut_spray (0.16 -> 0.44 -> 0.22) AND
shp.ok.in_band -> cut_spray (0.15 -> 0.41 -> 0.20). Eligibility trace
e^{{-0.76/0.90}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} / {aux['eta2']:.5f} /
{aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.250 / -0.220 / -0.210. Partial rollback of any pair
leaves the third at 0.50 / 0.44 / 0.41, all > 0.30 fire threshold —
fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the cure.

Independent LIF raster: window 38 ms, 168 neurons, 24.5 Hz, spikes
{ras['spikes']} == round(168 x 24.5 x 0.038), energy {ras['energy_pJ']} pJ
at 23 pJ/spike. excerpt_source=independent_lif, sim_scope=sidecar_only,
seed 23001. Excerpt is membrane crossings (lif.hold early vs lif.noz
