Adjacent thermal-header rounds (r64 malt kiln, r61 sinter, r22 prill)
share industrial-process scaffolding but not HRSG spray-lock physics.
Weighing a new failure family + cure vocabulary + leftover sub-domain +
Sprayholt geography against those reused scaffolds:

{NOVEL_LINE}

## What ROUND 24 should add
